Reading an XML dataset in R
First, install and load the XML package.
install.packages("XML")
library(XML)

# Read XML file
data <- xmlParse("D:/data.xml")

# Display XML data
print(data)


To read XML from the web:
url <- "https://example.com/data.xml"

data <- xmlParse(url)
print(data)
